  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vietnam Livestock Competitiveness and Food Safety</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project development objectives (PDOs) are to increase the production efficiency of household-based livestock producers, to reduce the environmental impact of livestock production, processing and marketing, and to improve food safety in livestock product supply chains (mainly meat) in selected provinces.</narrative>
  </description>
